it was you."

00:07:42.161 --> 00:07:44.130 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he goes,
"Would you sell it to me?

00:07:46.165 --> 00:07:48.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can I get it from you?"
And I was like --

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:49.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
He goes, "You know,
I grew up in Chicago with him.

00:07:49.969 --> 00:07:53.473 size:84% position:42%
I love motorcycles."
And I go, "Yeah, okay."

00:07:53.473 --> 00:07:56.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because, you know, he didn't
have anything of Chris's,

00:07:56.576 --> 00:07:59.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I thought, "You know,
he's a Chicago guy,

00:07:59.111 --> 00:08:01.514
and it was from Chicago,"
so I gave to it Timmy,

00:08:01.514 --> 00:08:04.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he sent me some of
the money, so it was great

00:08:04.784 --> 00:08:07.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Just some?

00:08:07.253 --> 00:08:09.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, he did.
He sent me all of it,

00:08:09.388 --> 00:08:11.858 line:92%
but what -- then my guy says -

00:08:11.858 --> 00:08:13.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go, "Timmy's gonna
send the money."

00:08:13.526 --> 00:08:16.395
And then they said, "Oh."
And then later they go,

00:08:16.395 --> 00:08:17.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You know, it's way more
than that 'cause of

00:08:17.797 --> 00:08:19.232 align:start size:94% position:6%
the auction fees
and all the taxes --"

00:08:19.232 --> 00:08:21.100 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I go, "Yeah,"
and they go, "Tell Tim."

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go, "I'm not telling Tim."
[ Both laugh ]

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:26.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I call him,
"Hey, Tim, eh...

00:08:26.539 --> 00:08:28.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's just a couple grand,
but if you could --

00:08:28.508 --> 00:08:32.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can meet you on La Cienega."
[ Laughter ]

00:08:32.078 --> 00:08:34.113
I sort of --
I would hate for him to see this

00:08:34.113 --> 00:08:36.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
and send me money.
This would be horrible.

00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:39.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
Worst-case scenario.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:39.051 --> 00:08:40.520 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm glad --
That's very kind of you.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:43.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's a really nice outcome
And congrats on the show.

00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:48.194
It's really fun to see you b
able to tell jokes on TV again

00:08:48.194 --> 00:08:50.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thanks very much
for being here, Dave.

00:08:50.229 --> 00:08:51.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Love it, Seth.
Miss you.

00:08:51.464 --> 00:08:52.265 line:92%
